sequenceDiagram
    actor Elena as Elena Petrov
    participant Source as Approved Export Staging
    participant Service as CMP-004 Knowledge Preparation Service
    participant Validator as Metadata and Path Validator
    participant Parser as Strict UTF-8 Parser
    participant Chunker as Structure-aware Line Chunker
    participant Store as Immutable Prepared Corpus
    participant Eval as CMP-008 Corpus Validator

    Elena->>Service: prepare(manifest.json)
    Service->>Validator: validate source descriptors and access scope
    Validator-->>Service: fail closed or accepted descriptors
    loop Each approved source
        Service->>Source: read bounded relative path
        Source-->>Service: raw bytes
        Service->>Parser: strict UTF-8 parse and newline normalization
        Parser-->>Service: hashes, lines, risk flags
        Service->>Chunker: source version + lines + metadata
        Chunker-->>Service: deterministic line-exact chunks
        Service->>Store: atomic version package write
        Store-->>Service: CREATED or REUSED
    end
    Service->>Store: atomically update corpus manifest and run record
    Service->>Eval: validate hashes, coordinates, access propagation, coverage
    Eval-->>Elena: pass/fail report
